{
  "description": "computer-use v2 epoch (row 14), reportMode object: engine.hello lists epoch; ref e1 is read, window 101 captured, then the scripted display reconfiguration lands on the next backend call: the click on the old frameId is refused InvalidCoordinateFrame reason superseded, not_delivered/safe (nothing sent), with epoch.changed reason display; the ref read before the move is StaleRef; a fresh capture takes input again.",
